    "description": "<p>So Speaks Malfeas permanently alters the costs and mechanics of the Infernal's Malfeas Excellency suite. The First Malfeas Excellency now provides two dice per mote spent rather than one, and the Second Malfeas Excellency now provides one automatic success per mote spent rather than one per two motes. Malfeas Inevitability Technique no longer requires a Willpower expenditure, costing four motes instead. So Speaks Malfeas is incompatible with Effortless Malfeas Dominance.</p>",
